2399:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * The GROUP SCAN request source functional block converts channels sequentially starting with the 
2400:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * channel to the lowest. Channels must register themselves as being part of the the scan sequence.
2401:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * A call to this API will first disable the arbitration slot for queue (XMC_VADC_GROUP_ScanEnableA
2402:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * and then it would configure all the related registers with the required configuration values.
2403:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * The arbitration slot is re-enabled at the end of init by invoking XMC_VADC_GROUP_ScanDisableArbi
2404:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * A call to this API would configure the registers GxARBPR, GxASCTRL, GxASMR needed scan request s
2405:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  *
