2481:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Selects the trigger edge for scan request source.<BR>\n
2482:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * A scan request source will raise conversion request only if there were either a request from app
2483:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * occurrence of a hardware trigger. This API selects one of the 4 possible trigger edges. This is
2484:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * needed when a hardware trigger is needed for the conversion of the scan request source.
