2517:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Selects the gating mode of scan request source.<BR>\n
2518:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Passage of the trigger input to the request source can be controlled via a gating signal.
2519:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * This API determines how the gating signal behaves, either active low or active high.
2520:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * If gating signal needs to ignored XMC_VADC_GATEMODE_IGNORE should be used as the \a mode_sel.
