3291:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * A call to this API would configure the registers GxARBPR, GxQCTRL0, GxQMR0 to configure the queu
3292:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * source.
