3306:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * Enables arbitration slot of the queue request source.<BR>\n
3307:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * If the QUEUE request source must have its conversion request considered by the arbiter, it must 
3308:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * the arbitration rounds. Even if a load event occurs the queue channel can only be converted when
3309:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * to the queue slot. Thus this must be enabled if any conversion need to take place.
3310:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * A call to this API would configure the register bit field GxARBPR.ASEN0.
3311:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  *
3312:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * \par<b>Related APIs:</b><br>
