3382:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * @param group_ptr     Constant pointer to the VADC group
3383:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_vadc.h ****  * @param input_num  Choice of the input earmarked as the gating line
